'''Ginger''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is made out of gingerbread with white frosting dripping from the tip, hence the name. It also has a lime green bowtie, and three pieces of candy, two of them being red and one of them being lime green. The guard is red, and the handle is made out of gingerbread with white frosting swirls around it.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Ginger Gun (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ginger Set (Legendary)|Ginger Set]].
*Its decal, published by [[didi1147]] on December 18, 2018, can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/2659488707/Gingerbread-knife here].
* There was a bug where if players equipped the [[Knifeception]] effect with this knife, small images of [[Sweater Knife (2018)]]’s decal would appear. However, this has since been patched.

